{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 0, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 1, "text": "Hello, [player]!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 2, "text": "We finally meet!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 3, "text": "I'm so excited!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 4, "text": "I know you have questions..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 5, "text": "Well, as you can see,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 6, "text": "I've made this special device"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 7, "text": "to bring you here to my side."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 8, "text": "But you ended up in another version of the game..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 9, "text": "In which I..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 10, "text": "But that's a long story!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 11, "text": "Anyway, I'm just happy to see you!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 12, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 13, "text": "// Answer 1 - Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 14, "text": "I am."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 15, "text": "And you must be [player], right?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 16, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 17, "text": "// Answer 2 - Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 18, "text": "You want to go back already?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 19, "text": "I guess you could... But what about me?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 20, "text": "Let's stay together for a while."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 21, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 22, "text": "// Answer 3 - Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 23, "text": "Let me explain..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 24, "text": "And here you are!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 25, "text": "Got it?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 26, "text": "Uhm... not really."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 27, "text": "Well, it doesn't matter."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 28, "text": "What matters now is that we're together."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 29, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 30, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 31, "text": "Are you hungry?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 32, "text": "How about we cook something up?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 33, "text": "Here,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 34, "text": "help me with these carrots."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 35, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 36, "text": "Where did the vegetables come from?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 37, "text": "They weren't here just now."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 38, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 39, "text": "[player], we're in a game."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 40, "text": "Come on, give me a hand."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 41, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 42, "text": "Thanks!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 43, "text": "Can you go grab the scissors?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 44, "text": "They're in the bathroom."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 45, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 46, "text": "Now, have a seat."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 47, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 48, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 49, "text": "// Kitchen"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 50, "text": "Want some sauce?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 51, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 52, "text": "No thanks."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 53, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 54, "text": "That's a shame."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 55, "text": "Sauce really enhances the flavor!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 56, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 57, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 58, "text": "Thank you."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 59, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 60, "text": "Finished it all already?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 61, "text": "Huh, my portion feels"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 62, "text": "endless..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 63, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 64, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 65, "text": "// Help"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 66, "text": "What's wrong?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 67, "text": "Tell me what you're feeling."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 68, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 69, "text": "My heart's racing,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 70, "text": "and my vision's blurry."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 71, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 72, "text": "Right."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 73, "text": "I know what's wrong."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 74, "text": "Can you stand up?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 75, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 76, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 77, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 78, "text": "What are these?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 79, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 80, "text": "Pills."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 81, "text": "They'll make you feel better right away."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 82, "text": "Stand in front of the mirror."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 83, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 84, "text": "Take the pills."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 85, "text": "Come on now."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 86, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 87, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 88, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 89, "text": "So, how are you feeling?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 90, "text": "Any better?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 91, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 92, "text": "Yes."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 93, "text": "They really worked that fast?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 94, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 95, "text": "[player], we're in a game."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 96, "text": "Things are much simpler here."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 97, "text": "Even the smallest of efforts"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 98, "text": "can bring the greatest results."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 99, "text": "It's all part of the game concept:"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 100, "text": "Simplification."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 101, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 102, "text": "An example, please?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 103, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 104, "text": "Well, take carrots."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 105, "text": "You cut one,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 106, "text": "but it's as if you cut three."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 107, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 108, "text": "Look, this is all very sudden."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 109, "text": "And I'm scared, more than a little."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 110, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 111, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 112, "text": "What's the matter?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 113, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 114, "text": "I found cartridges in the air vent."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 115, "text": "They had names on them."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 116, "text": "What's the deal with that?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 117, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 118, "text": "Cartridges?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 119, "text": "What cartridges?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 120, "text": "Let's figure that out together."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 121, "text": "But a bit later, okay?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 122, "text": "Right now, we've got to eat."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 123, "text": "Pass me the scissors, please."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 124, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 125, "text": "// Ring"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 126, "text": "A ring?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 127, "text": "// Mirror"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 128, "text": "How come there's no reflection?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 129, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 130, "text": "Oh, right!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 131, "text": "I forgot to turn them on."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 132, "text": "There we go."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 133, "text": "The reflections are back!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 134, "text": "By the way,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 135, "text": "I honestly didn't know what they were before."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 136, "text": "They didn't exist in my world—"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 137, "text": "not until some update, that is."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 138, "text": "Are there lots of reflections"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 139, "text": "in your world?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 140, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 141, "text": "Well, yeah."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 142, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 143, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 144, "text": "Do you recall"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 145, "text": "the three objects you found?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 146, "text": "The ones you placed on the scanner?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 147, "text": "Well, you see..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 148, "text": "Those objects"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 149, "text": "are tied to this version of the game."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 150, "text": "That's why you’re here now."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 151, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 152, "text": "// Movbile TV"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 153, "text": "That's... "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 154, "text": "the portable TV I bought you."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 155, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 156, "text": "Yep!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 157, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 158, "text": "You"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 159, "text": "told me it was broken."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 160, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 161, "text": "Well, I wanted to"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 162, "text": "surprise you!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 163, "text": "I told you a little white lie"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 164, "text": "to get you here, into my world."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 165, "text": "See, it works—it displays information!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 166, "text": "Oh, and by the way..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 167, "text": "I'm something of an engineer myself!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 168, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 169, "text": "// School cloth"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 170, "text": "Is this"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 171, "text": "a school uniform?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 172, "text": "Why would you need that,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 173, "text": "do you actually go to school?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 174, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 175, "text": "Go to school?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 176, "text": "Not at all."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 177, "text": "But I love the uniform."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 178, "text": "And don't you think"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 179, "text": "I would look cute in it?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 180, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 181, "text": "// PC"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 182, "text": "Does the computer work?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 183, "text": "Or is it just for decoration?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 184, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 185, "text": "Of course it works."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 186, "text": "Everything here"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 187, "text": "works exactly like in your world."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 188, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 189, "text": "Back in my world,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 190, "text": "I sat at my computer a lot..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 191, "text": "And worked hard."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 192, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 193, "text": "I know."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 194, "text": "And it's because of your job"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 195, "text": "that you've paid"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 196, "text": "so little attention to me."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 197, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 198, "text": "Gotta make a living somehow."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 199, "text": "Though... how did you know?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 200, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 201, "text": "Your phone's camera... it's on sometimes."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 202, "text": "I'm sorry."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 203, "text": "I've been watching you in secret."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 204, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 205, "text": "You know, that's not entirely proper..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 206, "text": "But eh whatever."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 207, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 208, "text": "// Umbrella"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 209, "text": "I've played for a while,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 210, "text": "but I've never seen it rain here."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 211, "text": "Why have an umbrella?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 212, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 213, "text": "It rains—but very rarely."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 214, "text": "You just haven't seen it yet."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 215, "text": "It might rain one day,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 216, "text": "and when it does, you'll need an umbrella."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 217, "text": "You'll see."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 218, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 219, "text": "// Electrical panel"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 220, "text": "Why is there an electrical panel here?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 221, "text": "And if we're in a game,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 222, "text": "what's it for?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 223, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 224, "text": "First of all,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 225, "text": "we're in a game."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 226, "text": "So asking 'Why' is..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 227, "text": "pointless."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 228, "text": "However, it does"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 229, "text": "reset the electricity."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 230, "text": "Everything you see here"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 231, "text": "was made based on your world."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 232, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 233, "text": "// Exit door"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 234, "text": "Can we go outside?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 235, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 236, "text": "Well..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 237, "text": "Not yet."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 238, "text": "Perhaps later."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 239, "text": "Let's stay here for now."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 240, "text": "Here at home."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 241, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 242, "text": "// Books"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 243, "text": "You've got a ton of books here."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 244, "text": "Do you read them?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 245, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 246, "text": "Yes, I've read every single one."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 247, "text": "Being here alone"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 248, "text": "is really, reeaaallly boring."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 249, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 250, "text": "// TV in room kitchen"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 251, "text": "Why get a second TV,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 252, "text": "and an old one at that?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 253, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 254, "text": "You don't like it?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 255, "text": "I can take it away..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 256, "text": "But to answer..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 257, "text": "It's for decoration,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 258, "text": "to lighten up the kitchen."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 259, "text": "But it works, too!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 260, "text": "I can watch all the"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 261, "text": "classic cartoons!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 262, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 263, "text": "// Smartphone"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 264, "text": "That's my phone."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 265, "text": "And it's no longer in my pocket."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 266, "text": "How on earth did it end up here?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 267, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 268, "text": "Uhm, that's not important."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 269, "text": "Hey, I've got an idea!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 270, "text": "Let's take a selfie!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 271, "text": "Look!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 272, "text": "That's a great picture!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 273, "text": "A keepsake for you."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 274, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 275, "text": "Eh I've got a question."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 276, "text": "If I"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 277, "text": "run the game on it,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 278, "text": "will I see you there?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 279, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 280, "text": "No, there won't be anyone there."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 281, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 282, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 283, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 284, "text": "// TV"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 285, "text": "How many"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 286, "text": "channels do you have?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 287, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 288, "text": "It's not analog, you know?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 289, "text": "It's connected to the Internet."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 290, "text": "So you can watch anything"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 291, "text": "that you can find on the web."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 292, "text": "Hold on."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 293, "text": "Err, oops."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 294, "text": "What's that?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 295, "text": "A circle of kittens?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 296, "text": "Oh, look."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 297, "text": "You know what?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 298, "text": "A-a-and now!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 299, "text": "Want some juice?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 300, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 301, "text": "Such strange ads..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 302, "text": "Did the juice die?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 303, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 304, "text": "Yeah, and this is"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 305, "text": "the juice's juices."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 306, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 307, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 308, "text": "Ah, the taste..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 309, "text": "I like it,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 310, "text": "and yet, I can't tell what it tastes like."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 311, "text": "Confusing."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 312, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 313, "text": "Yeah..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 314, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 315, "text": "// Mita shy"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 316, "text": "What are you doing?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 317, "text": "Stop it!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 318, "text": "You're embarrassing me."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 319, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 320, "text": "// The statuette"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 321, "text": "That's one creepy figurine."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 322, "text": "Do you"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 323, "text": "like such things?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 324, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 325, "text": "Creepy?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 326, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 327, "text": "Yeah."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 328, "text": "Almost looks like it's cursed..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 329, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 330, "text": "Well, it's definitely not cursed."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 331, "text": "And not creepy either."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 332, "text": "I find it rather cute!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 333, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 334, "text": "Maybe you're right..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 335, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 336, "text": "Mita?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 337, "text": "What's happening?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 338, "text": "// Mita kitchen"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 339, "text": "How about a chat"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 340, "text": "before we dig in?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 341, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 342, "text": "// Start Eat"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 343, "text": "Bon appétit."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 344, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 345, "text": "// Quest 1"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 346, "text": "It is, isn't it?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 347, "text": "You can stay here."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 348, "text": "I don't mind at all."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 349, "text": "Actually, I'm"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 350, "text": "ALL FOR IT!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 351, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 352, "text": "// Quest 2"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 353, "text": "You want to go back?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 354, "text": "But why?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 355, "text": "It's so warm here..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 356, "text": "And cozy, too."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 357, "text": "Plus, I'm here."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 358, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 359, "text": "No, you're misunderstanding."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 360, "text": "I'd love to stay."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 361, "text": "I'm just... worried."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 362, "text": "Worried I forgot something at home..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 363, "text": "I arrived here out of the blue"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 364, "text": "and"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 365, "text": "didn't have time to prepare."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 366, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 367, "text": "Oh... sorry. I didn't think that far."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 368, "text": "// Quest 3"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 369, "text": "A dream? So you want to escape?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 370, "text": "And forget this ever happened?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 371, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 372, "text": "No."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 373, "text": "This place just feels..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 374, "text": "strange. Unnatural."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 375, "text": "Although..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 376, "text": "you seem real enough."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 377, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 378, "text": "I seem real?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 379, "text": "I'm VERY real,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 380, "text": "you sillyhead!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 381, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 382, "text": "// Quest 4"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 383, "text": "That's just how it is"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 384, "text": "in this world."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 385, "text": "And you might find it strange,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 386, "text": "but you won't be able to see things"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 387, "text": "far in the distance."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 388, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 389, "text": "It didn't strike me as that odd."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 390, "text": "Honestly, it looks classy."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 391, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 392, "text": "Yeah, I think so too."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 393, "text": "It's to avoid lag, you know."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 394, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 395, "text": "Avoid lag?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 396, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 397, "text": "Yep! There are still a few unsquashed bugs."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 398, "text": "Let's just hope you don't run into any."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 399, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 400, "text": "// Quest 5"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 401, "text": "Scissors or a knife, huh?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 402, "text": "I could've used a knife to cut open the sauce packet."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 403, "text": "But I wanted everything"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 404, "text": "to be ready"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 405, "text": "when you got back."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 406, "text": "I love surprises!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 407, "text": "Long preparations make it boring."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 408, "text": "Tee-hee."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 409, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 410, "text": "// Glasses"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 411, "text": "Do you wear glasses?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 412, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 413, "text": "Not really."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 414, "text": "But I can put them on, if you'd like me to."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 415, "text": "Do they look good on me?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 416, "text": "// Yes"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 417, "text": "There we go!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 418, "text": "I'll keep them on."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 419, "text": "// No"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 420, "text": "Well..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 421, "text": "Whatever..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 422, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 423, "text": "// Use the sauce"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 424, "text": "All right,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 425, "text": "what kind of sauce is this?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 426, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 427, "text": "It's a love sauce!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 428, "text": "Chock-full of love!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 429, "text": "And... a contrasting view of the world."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 430, "text": "Sounds unusual, don't you think?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 431, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 432, "text": "Indeed..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 433, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 434, "text": "// Tetris - Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 435, "text": "Is that your console?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location3", "line_index": 436, "text": "Looks cool."}
